Structure point: Field x as integer. Field y as integer. End structure.

Declare i as integer.
Declare p as pointer to integer.
Declare arr as array of integer with length 3.
Declare s as structure point.
Declare f as decimal.
Declare b as boolean.

Say "scalar i =".
Say i.
Say "pointer p null?".
If p is equal to null pointer then: Say "yes". End if.
Say "array slot 2 =".
Say Element at 2 in arr.
Say "struct s.x =".
Say Member x of s.
Say "decimal f =".
Say f.
Say "boolean b =".
Say b.